role: event

= Parlament votes on Education Privatization

{!<div id="parlament" data-widget="hemicycle" data-props='{"configFrom":"parlament_hemicycle"}'></div>!}

[? if education_minister_gender = "m": Conseller ?][? if education_minister_gender = "f": Consellera ?]of Education [+ education_minister +], working under the current [+ cat_coalition_disp +], is bringing forward quite a controversial proposal. The effective burial of the public education system is about to be voted.

- @vote: Let's see where the chamber stands...

@vote




@on_yes
on-arrival: {!
    G.deactivateLaw(Q, "education_privatized", undefined, false, "red");
    Q.government_budget += 1;
    Q.education_spending = -3;
!}
call: generalitat_setpolicy

@on_no
on-arrival: {!
    G.deactivateLaw(Q, "education_privatized", undefined, false, "red");
!}